W:Si me dan pasteles, dénmelos calientes,
W:que pasteles fríos empachan la gente.
W:(If you give me pasteles, give them to me hot, for cold pasteles give people a stomach-ache.)
W:
W:A variant Luce quotes:
W:Denme mi aguinaldo, si me lo han de dar,
W:que la noche es corta y tenemos que andar.
W:(Give me my aguinaldo, if you are going to give it, for the night is short and we have far to go.)
